  "body": "Welcome to 13B Liam Place, a stunning modern home located in the desirable Half Moon Bay neighborhood. This beautifully constructed property, completed in 2025, offers a perfect blend of comfort and contemporary living.\r\n\r\nFeaturing four spacious bedrooms and two well-appointed bathrooms, this home is designed to accommodate families of all sizes. With an additional three toilets, convenience is at your fingertips. The master suite includes an ensuite bathroom, providing a private retreat for relaxation.\r\n\r\nThe heart of the home is the modern open-plan kitchen and dining area, perfect for entertaining or family gatherings. Equipped with high-quality appliances including a gas cooktop, wall oven, and dishwasher, this kitchen is a chef's dream. The adjoining lounge offers a separate space to unwind, complete with ample natural light and a cozy atmosphere.\r\n\r\nStep outside to enjoy the decking and patio area, ideal for outdoor entertaining or simply soaking up the sun. The property is partially fenced, providing a safe space for children and pets to play.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include a single garage with internal access and automatic doors, ensuring easy entry and exit. The home is equipped with a heat pump for year-round comfort, and the insulation in the ceilings and walls guarantees energy efficiency.\r\n\r\nLocated on a 197 sqm land area, this property is conveniently situated close to local shops, schools, and transport options. Enjoy the benefits of town water and mains sewage, making daily living effortless.\r\n\r\nThis property is in very good condition, both inside and out, with stylish flooring and a weatherboard timber exterior. With a price guide of Price by Negotiation, this is an opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nDiscover your dream home at 13B Liam Place, where modern living meets convenience in the heart of Half Moon Bay. Schedule a viewing today!",
